menu "OpenSensor uploader"

config OS_UPLOAD_ENABLE
    bool "Upload finalized archive files to source.coop"
    default n
    help
        Builds the uploader as enabled. Off by default. Nothing uploads
        until a board is provisioned with an API key and the integration
        work wires a session into the storage worker. Dev uploads only ever
        write below dev/opensensor-space-firmware/<board>/ (#81).

endmenu
